|i39 : frobeniusNu(5, f, Verbose => true)       |
|nuInternal: using comparison test FrobeniusRoot|
|ν(1) = 0                                       |
|ν(p^1) = 1                                     |
|ν(p^2) = 8                                     |
|ν(p^3) = 44                                    |
|ν(p^4) = 224                                   |
|ν(p^5) = 1124                                  |
|                                               |
|o39 = 1124                                     |
